{
    "title": "Golf Clash - Golfing Simulator",
    "description": "The BAFTA-winning golf game is better than ever, and it's free to download!\r\n\r\nStep into the ultimate golf simulator and embark on a journey to master your golfing skills. Whether you prefer to golf with friends or challenge new opponents, our online multiplayer golf game offers an extraordinary golf experience!\r\n\r\nDive Into the Ultimate Online Multiplayer Golf Game & Simulator \r\n \u2022 Live your golf dreams! Choose your club, select your golf ball, and battle against golf rivals from around the globe on beautiful golf courses.\r\n \u2022 Master our first-ever single-player mode with a new progression system and unique rewards \u2014 \u201cRoad to Fame\u201d!\r\n \u2022 Engage in exciting 9-hole or full 18-hole matches, aiming for those satisfying birdies and even a hole-in-one.\r\n \u2022 Master our revolutionary golf shot mechanic \u2014 easy to learn, thrilling to master. Become a golf genius!\r\n \u2022 Place your ball on the tee, aim, and watch your shot soar across beautiful golf courses in one shot!\r\n\r\nOur Biggest Update Ever Has Just Dropped!\r\n \u2022 Experience our first-ever single-player mode \u2014 \u201cRoad to Fame\u201d!\r\n \u2022 Play much faster without waiting for your opponent to make a move.\r\n \u2022 Play it your way \u2014 choose your own path through lots of golf courses!\r\n \u2022 Collect sponsors & upgrade your unique club set.\r\n \u2022 Earn great golf rewards as your Fame increases.\r\n \u2022 Compete with your friends in seasonal leaderboards!\r\n\r\nMore Modes, More Golfing, More Rewards\r\n \u2022 Golf in weekly leagues to earn legendary rewards and gear!\r\n \u2022 Take on the Check Point Challenge: golf with randomized clubs and unlock chests with guaranteed epics!\r\n \u2022 Master your golfing skills and show off your unbelievable accuracy in Golden Shot to earn  legendary rewards \u2014 bring your top golf game!\r\n \u2022 Golf against your rivals in officially licensed golfing tournaments on real golf courses!\r\n\r\nConquer Your Golf Rivals\r\n \u2022 Putt your ball & pave your way through online global tournaments to become the ultimate golf king!\r\n \u2022 Unlock legendary clubs with unique attributes to gain an edge on the golf course.\r\n \u2022 Collect over 600 golf balls with various characteristics to suit your playing style.\r\n \u2022 Master your online golfing skills in 13 challenging tours \u2014 become the ultimate golf king!\r\n \u2022 Tee off in the ultimate golf simulator on lots of unique and real-life golf courses.\r\n\r\nPersonalize Your Game\r\n \u2022 Unlock vanity rewards like hole explosions, tees, and emotes through the free season track!\r\n \u2022 Buy into the optional Golf Pass to get even more legendary rewards (requires in-game purchases).\r\n\r\nJoin a Vibrant Online Community\r\n \u2022 Become part of a Golf Clash clan and battle it out in team-based leaderboards.\r\n \u2022 Share replays of your most impressive golf shots.\r\n \u2022 Engage with friends and rivals using in-game chat and emotes.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to perfect your putt or dominate in online golfing tournaments, Golf Clash offers the ultimate golf simulator experience. Download now and tee off on your path to becoming a true golf king!\r\n\r\nThis app: Requires acceptance of EA\u2019s Privacy & Cookie Policy and User Agreement. Requires an Internet connection (network fees may apply). Contains direct links to the Internet and social networking sites intended for an audience over 13. Allows players to communicate. This game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items, including a random selection of virtual in-game items.\r\n\r\nUser Agreement: terms.ea.com\r\nPrivacy and Cookie Policy: privacy.ea.com\r\nVisit help.ea.com for assistance or inquiries.\r\n\r\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information: https://tos.ea.com/legalapp/WEBPRIVACYCA/US/en/PC/\r\n\r\nEA may retire online features after 30 days\u2019 notice posted on ea.com/service-updates.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The BAFTA-winning golf game is better than ever, and it&#39;s free to download!<br><br>Step into the ultimate golf simulator and embark on a journey to master your golfing skills. Whether you prefer to golf with friends or challenge new opponents, our online multiplayer golf game offers an extraordinary golf experience!<br><br>Dive Into the Ultimate Online Multiplayer Golf Game &amp; Simulator <br> \u2022 Live your golf dreams! Choose your club, select your golf ball, and battle against golf rivals from around the globe on beautiful golf courses.<br> \u2022 Master our first-ever single-player mode with a new progression system and unique rewards \u2014 \u201cRoad to Fame\u201d!<br> \u2022 Engage in exciting 9-hole or full 18-hole matches, aiming for those satisfying birdies and even a hole-in-one.<br> \u2022 Master our revolutionary golf shot mechanic \u2014 easy to learn, thrilling to master. Become a golf genius!<br> \u2022 Place your ball on the tee, aim, and watch your shot soar across beautiful golf courses in one shot!<br><br>Our Biggest Update Ever Has Just Dropped!<br> \u2022 Experience our first-ever single-player mode \u2014 \u201cRoad to Fame\u201d!<br> \u2022 Play much faster without waiting for your opponent to make a move.<br> \u2022 Play it your way \u2014 choose your own path through lots of golf courses!<br> \u2022 Collect sponsors &amp; upgrade your unique club set.<br> \u2022 Earn great golf rewards as your Fame increases.<br> \u2022 Compete with your friends in seasonal leaderboards!<br><br>More Modes, More Golfing, More Rewards<br> \u2022 Golf in weekly leagues to earn legendary rewards and gear!<br> \u2022 Take on the Check Point Challenge: golf with randomized clubs and unlock chests with guaranteed epics!<br> \u2022 Master your golfing skills and show off your unbelievable accuracy in Golden Shot to earn  legendary rewards \u2014 bring your top golf game!<br> \u2022 Golf against your rivals in officially licensed golfing tournaments on real golf courses!<br><br>Conquer Your Golf Rivals<br> \u2022 Putt your ball &amp; pave your way through online global tournaments to become the ultimate golf king!<br> \u2022 Unlock legendary clubs with unique attributes to gain an edge on the golf course.<br> \u2022 Collect over 600 golf balls with various characteristics to suit your playing style.<br> \u2022 Master your online golfing skills in 13 challenging tours \u2014 become the ultimate golf king!<br> \u2022 Tee off in the ultimate golf simulator on lots of unique and real-life golf courses.<br><br>Personalize Your Game<br> \u2022 Unlock vanity rewards like hole explosions, tees, and emotes through the free season track!<br> \u2022 Buy into the optional Golf Pass to get even more legendary rewards (requires in-game purchases).<br><br>Join a Vibrant Online Community<br> \u2022 Become part of a Golf Clash clan and battle it out in team-based leaderboards.<br> \u2022 Share replays of your most impressive golf shots.<br> \u2022 Engage with friends and rivals using in-game chat and emotes.<br><br>Whether you&#39;re looking to perfect your putt or dominate in online golfing tournaments, Golf Clash offers the ultimate golf simulator experience. Download now and tee off on your path to becoming a true golf king!<br><br>This app: Requires acceptance of EA\u2019s Privacy &amp; Cookie Policy and User Agreement. Requires an Internet connection (network fees may apply). Contains direct links to the Internet and social networking sites intended for an audience over 13. Allows players to communicate. This game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items, including a random selection of virtual in-game items.<br><br>User Agreement: terms.ea.com<br>Privacy and Cookie Policy: privacy.ea.com<br>Visit help.ea.com for assistance or inquiries.<br><br>Do Not Sell My Personal Information: https://tos.ea.com/legalapp/WEBPRIVACYCA/US/en/PC/<br><br>EA may retire online features after 30 days\u2019 notice posted on ea.com/service-updates.",
